  triage:description "docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-40-local-transport-benchmark.md:67 still reads \"Extend AI.33's scripts/smoke/run_admission_capacity.py; do not create a second admission gate,\" directly contradicting docs/project-plan.md:1019 (\"clean local transport throughput benchmark; not an extension of abandoned AI.33 script\") and the corrected canonical sprint-doc language established earlier in AI.40's QA history. The rebuild on fix/ai40-benchmark-artifact-cleanup appears to have carried forward a pre-correction copy of the sprint doc. Confirmed directly by arch-qa during AI40-CLEANUP-QA-1 (PR #712 @ bff39d95)." ;
